caption: Advantages and Permissions
tradition-component: advantages-and-permissions

Basic Psi access under the shared Psi Origin rules.

The fixed Path Talent and general Advanced access to Psychic Vampirism, Machine Telepathy, or Illusion, as appropriate.

Psychic Patterns and one Current Prey.

Stable Hunter traits limited by Only Against Current Prey, -20%.

Super-Memorization for adaptive negation abilities, with no additional Dreadhound capacity cap.

Realized Revelations may serve as Required Disadvantages on Dreadhound Super-Memorization, and any Eldritch Core Gift, Latent or Realized, may supply a non-prey slot configuration as described under Eldritch Core Interface.

The Anti-Talent secondary-slot exception and doubled-Talent loaded-ability cap rule described above.

Normal Eldritch Reserve and universal Eldritch Gifts Tier 2 permissions.
